<title>USA: GOLF-ELS WINS 97TH U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ELS WINS 97TH U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Maryland 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ernie Els of South Africa won the 97th U.S. Open golf championship by one stroke on Sunday.</p>
